From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blong <belohnung@protonmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:42:41 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Let the embedding client replace the call's own sounds

A soundOverrides URL parameter (JSON, sound name -> URL) replaces the
sounds Element Call fetches for itself, so an embedding client can theme
call sounds. Names not listed keep the default; malformed JSON is logged
and ignored. A ringtoneIntro override plays once before the outgoing
ringtone loop starts; without one nothing extra plays.

Ported to v0.24.0 from largelanguagemeowing/cinny fd40bed7 (its
0002-sound-overrides.patch, vendored in 7241a108). Since 0.20.1 the
outgoing ring moved from InCallView into RingingAudioRenderer and its
sound was renamed waiting -> ringtone, so the intro is ringtoneIntro
here (waitingIntro in the source). The mutedSounds and soundHandoff
follow-ups (8ccc5acc, 28e84596) are left out: they belong to the
fork's per-sound switches and host-played end sounds, which this
client does not have.
